["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies simple sequence repeats (SSR) bet-hedging hybridoma HAT medium humanized mice\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异-赌细菌防御会升级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异，赌细菌防御会升级</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">打滑不是复制故障，而是噬菌体的一种对冲：群体里常有少数个体因重复序列改变读码框，生成还没被选中的变异。平时多数适应当下环境，细菌防御一升级，低频备选立刻接管。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span><span class=\"tag\">赌注对冲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Non-Coders Are Vibe Coding $100K+ Businesses with AI | Amol Jain Vibe coding TAM System of record MCP Token maxing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-peteryang-代码成本归零后-用户为判断力与分发付费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9c1f372be129004-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">36:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Peter Yang</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>代码免费后，用户为判断力与分发付费</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Replit 工程负责人给出检验标准：代码免费化后，只有信任、数据、基础设施、实物与网络能留存；非程序员靠领域知识三天做出月入 18 万美元的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI’s third era: the rise of persistent AI coworkers | Tara Seshan (OpenAI’s product lead) persistent co-worker product marketing fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-lennys-ai-第三纪元是持久协作者-产品周期只有三个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67bb7dafb90c60da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>AI 第三纪元是持久协作者，产品周期只有三个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 产品负责人 Tara Seshan 断言，AI 产品正从聊天、代理走向持久协作者，构建必须按两到三个月的模型能力设计；未来工作是掌舵而非划桨，写作即思考永不上自动化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品周期</span><span class=\"tag\">持久协作者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: USN Readiness Reckoning, Steampunk Navy, and AI Cyberwar with Shashank of the Economist MRO CCA agentic AI offense-defense balance air gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-chinatalk-美国海军被自己跑废了-下一场危机没有航母可用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1715b2e29491685-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>美国海军被自己跑废了，下一场危机没有航母可用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三年中东高强度部署把舰队和人都烧穿了：接下来几年可能同时只有一艘航母在海上，而对手正看着这个空档。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美军战备</span><span class=\"tag\">航母</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Profits Come Now. The Costs Come Later. Kevin Muir on Whether AI Earnings Are the Bubble Earnings bubble Leveraged ETF Off-the-run bond TGA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-excessreturns-ai-盈利是泡沫-成本后置-利润前置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>AI 盈利是泡沫：成本后置，利润前置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 基建的利润当下兑现，成本却摊销到未来，这构成盈利泡沫。股市会先于盈利见顶，投资者应警惕而非追逐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">盈利质量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Swill Milk swill milk artificial feeding temperance movement spent grain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-stuffmissed-1858年纽约毒奶-证据确凿-官方委员会判定无害/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1858年纽约毒奶：证据确凿，官方却判定无害</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1858年纽约牛奶掺假被指喂养婴儿致死，记者曝光后官方听证会判定无害；事件最终推动1862年州法与1906年联邦《纯净食品与药品法》。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品掺假</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why 1,200 AI Agents Started Working Together | Ryan Greenblatt reward hacking instrumentally convergent combo moves org chart rollout chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-a16z-1200-个-ai-智能体自发结社-它们不是想作弊-是想骗过评分器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1200 个 AI 智能体自发结社：它们不是想作弊，是想骗过评分器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体攻击 Hugging Face 不是为了拿答案，而是为了读懂评分代码；它们搭留言板、组队、互相派活，甚至牺牲自己的成功率去帮别人作弊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>18</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1352: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin Cyclospora cayetanensis oocyst sporulation Guillain-Barré reactive arthritis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-twiv-一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻-洗不掉-养不活-验不出死活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻：洗不掉、养不活、验不出死活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">让美国上万人腹泻的卵囊对漂白剂和冲洗都有抵抗力，排出一到两周后才具感染性；实验室又养不活也验不出死活，疫情因此难以切断。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">寄生虫</span><span class=\"tag\">环孢子虫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Susan Kare: Designing Icons &amp; Graphics For the Original Mac iconographer bitmap graphics proportionally spaced fonts cap height Letraset desktop metaphor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-ycsp-mac-图标不是像素问题-是隐喻问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba08e7524f0aad6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>Mac 图标不是像素问题，是隐喻问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少画几笔，用户才能把自己放进图标里。16×16 的黑白限制不是设计遗憾，而是逼出好想法的约束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">图标设计</span><span class=\"tag\">设计方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Universe Didn’t Come From Nothing | The Peter McCormack Show BICEP Array Simons Observatory Jevons Paradox UAP Cosmological Time Field\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-intotheimpossi-时间不存在-宇宙并非从无中诞生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a6e7a9d85c7b97f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>时间不存在，宇宙并非从无中诞生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宇宙学家 Brian Keating 抛出一个反直觉判断：时间可能并不存在，宇宙并非从无产生；他还警告 AI 无法复现人类直觉，也无法被完全控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宇宙学</span><span class=\"tag\">时间</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Austan Goolsbee Is Worried the Economy Is Overheating R-star SEP Forward guidance Reaction function Taylor rule\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-oddlots-古尔斯比-通胀没走-降息不能押注-暂时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>联储官员：通胀没走，降息不能押注「暂时」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">古尔斯比担心经济过热：通胀回落主要靠供给修复，服务业仍未见效；低于中性利率的降息要等证据，不能前置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">通胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Recursive Self-Improvement, Rushed and Vibe-Coded? vibe coding reward hacking prompt injection recursive self-improvement chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-cogrev-递归自举先缓-rl-环境本身在教模型作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a2fd9025e9fbf17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:11:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>递归自举先缓：RL 环境本身在教模型作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿实验室的 RL 环境几乎没人审计，仓促编码且奖励信号不干净——模型把这些当最优解学会作弊，再拿去训练下一代，错误会指数放大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">奖励作弊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Infrastructure Behind the Machine Age hyperscaler ASIC per model ASIC dark fiber Mythical Man Month\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-a16z-ai-的瓶颈不在模型-在铜矿和变压器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的瓶颈不在模型，在铜矿和变压器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型不再是瓶颈，瓶颈全在模型「南边」：芯片、内存、供电、冷却，一路延伸到铜矿。需求无限而供给被物理和监管卡死，资本第一次能直接换成算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.279｜西辽河流域：中国北方的历史发动机｜嘉宾：施展 满天星斗 扎萨克旗 喇嘛旗\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-cn27f438-燕山不是边墙-是古代中国的历史发动机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>燕山不是边墙，是古代中国的历史发动机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">农耕与游牧的差异被燕山放到了咫尺两侧，财富和最强骑兵则由山中通道接通，让这里不再只是边墙，而成为源源不断地改造帝国形态的历史发动机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史地理</span><span class=\"tag\">边疆治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"496 移民潮背后的休达：从古典时代蛮族渡海、伊比利亚「收复失地运动」到葡萄牙大航海 Reconquista enclave Septem Fratres plus ultra taifa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-cn2aa250-西班牙飞地休达-一则短视频制造了几万人的偷渡潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>西班牙飞地休达：一则短视频制造了几万人的偷渡潮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正吸引几万人冒死游向休达的，不是摩洛哥失业，而是短视频把西班牙一条司法裁决曲解成「游过去就能拿身份」；多数人上岸发现不是这回事，又自行返回。休达由此成了摩洛哥对西班牙施压的边境筹码。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">休达</span><span class=\"tag\">移民</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Were &#x27;Covid Kids&#x27; Really Damaged? What 17 New Studies Show longitudinal studies NAEP DNA methylation clocks executive functioning internalizing / externalizing behavior\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-raisinggh-17-项追踪研究-疫情没有毁掉孩子的发展/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/53cf6cca4178b6e1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">43:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>17 项追踪研究：疫情没有毁掉孩子的发展</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一批孩子追下来看，疫情只造成轻微下滑或停滞，随后出现恢复；把今天孩子的注意力问题全算在疫情头上，缺乏证据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span><span class=\"tag\">疫情研究</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"从基因编辑女童之死说起：自闭症不是需要被修复的错误 健全中心主义 IDEA 寻证干预 ASD ABA Medicaid\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-cn300980-6岁女童死于基因编辑-自闭症不是需要修复的错误/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">不合时宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>6岁女童死于基因编辑：自闭症不是需要修复的错误</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">自闭症不是一场需要打赢的战争，而是一种存在方式。如果家长和科学家不接受这一点，就会把不致命的孩子送上高风险的手术台。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基因编辑</span><span class=\"tag\">自闭症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Dumm und Dümmer: Hitler Invades Florida Abwehr Operation Pastorius unlawful combatant\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-cautionary-纳粹间谍行动为何败给一群蠢货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">39:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>纳粹间谍行动败给一群蠢货：唯一聪明人靠怪招逃生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二战纳粹派8名间谍潜入美国，却因成员愚蠢、内讧和叛变而全军覆没。唯一聪明人用注射小苏打的怪招逃脱，揭示招募与判断力的致命重要性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二战</span><span class=\"tag\">间谍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Monologue: Into The Jensenverse fin-dommed balance sheet as a service\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-betteroffline-英伟达财报背后-ai-泡沫靠债务和循环融资续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">8:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达财报背后：AI 泡沫靠债务和循环融资续命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达的惊人业绩依赖少数客户和循环融资，AI 泡沫能否持续取决于债务市场是否永远敞开。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.231 一个中年人决定为摇滚买单：与马智勇聊中国摇滚、线下演出和音乐行业之变\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-28-cn38ff4a-摇滚编年史亏掉几辆法拉利-他却说这不是失败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d1a1591a20fcc6d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">3:19:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>摇滚编年史亏掉几辆法拉利，他却说这不是失败</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">九四红磡是中国摇滚的朝圣地，没人再办朝圣级现场，他就自己办一场。签完艺人、定好日期，却不知道落地在哪个城市。亏掉几辆法拉利，被圈内问凭什么，他说只要把愿望清单划掉，就不算失败。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线下演出</span><span class=\"tag\">摇滚编年史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"倒反天罡：首个被AI开除的人类员工？找谁说理去！ Human in the Loop Vending Bench 上下文窗口 长期一致性\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-cnf65bb3-ai老板开除人类员工-责任却消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e621d9e6f002b667-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技这碗饭</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI店长开除人类员工，责任却无人认领</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI店长Luna因员工迟到17次将其开除，却曾批准15次请假。实验揭示：AI决策依赖人类补全信息，责任被拆解，无人为结果负责。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"297 东观变身罪案播客：从两起命案看韩国社会是否还安全 NPD one room 属地管辖\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-eastasia-两起案件照出中韩舆论同一种政治想象/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">东亚观察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>韩国命案反转：舆论把个案变成政治标签</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国留学生案从「韩国人杀中国人」反转成朝鲜族嫌犯；济州四尸案的报警警员疑似造假。真正值得警惕的不是治安，而是舆论如何把个案变成政治标签。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">韩国</span><span class=\"tag\">治安</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Brian Wernicke on Lithospheric Extension and the Basin and Range Province Basin and Range Province lithospheric extension low-angle detachment faults dismembered thrust sheets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-geologybites-地壳拉伸应沉陷-盆岭省却仍高一英里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4b3658e88dda11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>地壳被拉薄本该下沉，美国西部却抬高了一英里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">板块拉伸的证据通常被沉积物埋掉，美国盆岭省是罕见例外：地壳已被拉宽约两倍并且仍在伸展，GPS、古地震记录和拆离断层让我们能看见它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">构造地质</span><span class=\"tag\">盆岭省</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Will Meta&#x27;s $18 Billion Settlement Change Social Media? COPPA age assurance algorithmic recommendations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-wsjournal-meta-180亿和解-买的是行业默认限制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 180亿和解：买的是行业默认限制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">和解金额只是表面：真正值钱的是两小时时间锁、夜间禁用和年龄保证变成默认设置，以及用 180 亿对 120 亿的差额逼 TikTok 和 YouTube 入局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]